    <!--
        Icons — hand-authored vector geometry. No icon font, no image files, nothing to go stale.

        Two coordinate systems:
          * App icons are drawn on a 24 x 24 grid and are STROKE artwork: render them with
            <pb:Icon Data="{StaticResource Icon.Crop}"/>, which strokes at 1.5 units and scales
            uniformly (16 px default ⇒ a 1 px stroke, crisp).
          * Icons whose name ends in ".Filled" (Icon.Star.Filled, Icon.Dot) are area artwork:
            render with <pb:Icon Filled="True" .../>.
          * Window-chrome glyphs (Chrome.*) are drawn on a 10 x 10 grid at 1 unit stroke so the
            title-bar buttons match Windows' own metrics.

        Colour always comes from the Icon's inherited Foreground — never set here.
    -->

